AB  - The AI-Based Trip Planning system is a web application that will assist in improving the process of traveling planning by offering personalized recommendations based on the preferences of the users, their health condition, and interests. Using the Gemini API and machine learning, the system is capable of producing optimization travel recommendations, which enables a smooth travelling experience to the traveller. This application will have two key modules: the Admin Module, which is going to regulate and update the information about destinations, local cuisine, and activities, and the User Module, where travelers are going to be able to input their preferences and have a personalized set of recommendations. Another feature of the system that is implemented to assure the confidentiality of the information of different users is the homomorphic encryption, which allows to process the data without the necessity to reveal its contents, and, thus, gives the system high confidentiality. The system also makes travel booking, which is user-friendly and provides a convenient all-in-one travel planning system. The integration of AI, machine learning and homomorphic encryption will help to change the planning process of the users and how they plan their journey to real-time, safe and personalized suggestions that fulfill the needs and wishes of individually selected traveler.
